  "releaseNotes": "Reduced 3D gradient-table gathers in Perlin and OpenSimplex2 while preserving exact scalar, SIMD and parallel outputs. Includes typed procedural graphs and LOD-resolved noise stacks for CPU and Vulkan terrain generation.",
